  "howToPlayBody": "Some cats are hiding under the leaves. Lift every leaf that has no cat under it.\n\nA click lifts a leaf, and the first one is always safe. A number tells how many cats are in the eight leaves around it.\n\nThe right button, or holding the click, puts a feather on a leaf you suspect, and a leaf with a feather cannot be lifted by accident.\n\nA click on a number lifts the leaves around it when the feathers there add up to that number. If a feather is in the wrong place, the cat gets out.\n\nCtrl+N starts a new game.",
  "aboutBody": "Find the cats hiding under the leaves, with cockatiels. No ads, no telemetry and no account.",
